162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (ORCA is four layers. Data adapters fetch and normalise; a deterministic science and decision core computes verdicts; an agent layer plans and explains; a client renders. Information flows upward only the core never asks the agent layer anything, which is what makes the safety guarantee checkable rather than aspirational.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [41]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 57 0 R
/T (Graceful degradation is a design property, not an accident)
/E (Graceful degradation is a design property, not an accident)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [42]
>>
endobj
164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (Every optional component has a declared fallback, and the running system reports which path it took. Postgres with PostGIS falls back to SQLite; Redis with an ARQ queue falls back to an in-process TTL cache with APScheduler; four LLM providers fall back to one another in order. The health endpoint names the active path and the reason for any fallback, so a degraded deployment is visible rather than silent.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [43]
>>
endobj
