/P 65 0 R
/T (Verification is part of the engineering, not a phase after it)
/E (Verification is part of the engineering, not a phase after it)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (Several findings in this report came from testing rather than from design. The flat drift error, a router that silently costed passages on wave height alone because an upstream returned HTTP 200 with an error body, and a refresh control that recomputed identical numbers from a cache were all found by measuring behaviour against expectation. Each is fixed, and each has a test that fails if it returns.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
