<<
/Title (Wave carries the largest weight because it is what capsizes a small hull. Both wave and wind terms are quadratic: a 2 m sea is far more than twice as dangerous as a 1 m sea to an 8 m boat, and a linear score would understate exactly the region where boats are lost.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1622 0 R
>>
endobj
