/Title (Three refusals matter as much as the equations. ORCA will not invent directional spread from wave direction alone, will not infer vessel beam from length, and will not map BSI linearly onto its 0-100 index. Where an input is genuinely unavailable, the component is reported as unverifiable rather than estimated.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1623 0 R
>>
