/Title (Significant wave height is a poor predictor of capsizing on its own. A 1.5 m sea with a short period is steep and dangerous; the same height with a long swell is comfortable. ORCA therefore implements the INCOIS Small Vessel Advisory and Forecast Services Boat Safety Index, using the published equations exactly as written.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1635 0 R
>>
endobj
